WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.771
"Oh no," said Cat.

2
00:00:05.772 --> 00:00:09.155
"Pig is stuck!" said Bat.

3
00:00:09.156 --> 00:00:12.223
"He is stuck in the mud!"

4
00:00:12.224 --> 00:00:15.342
"We must help," said Cow.

5
00:00:15.343 --> 00:00:18.480
"Dog, you pull on one side.

6
00:00:18.481 --> 00:00:29.327
I will pull on the other."

7
00:00:29.328 --> 00:00:31.518
Cow pulled.

8
00:00:31.519 --> 00:00:33.836
Dog pulled.

9
00:00:33.837 --> 00:00:38.205
Pig slipped and slid.

10
00:00:38.206 --> 00:00:41.167
But he was still stuck.

11
00:00:41.168 --> 00:00:45.953
Quack! Quack!

12
00:00:45.954 --> 00:00:49.195
The ducks came to see.

13
00:00:49.196 --> 00:00:52.521
Splish! Splash!

14
00:00:52.522 --> 00:00:55.196
The frogs came to see.

15
00:00:55.197 --> 00:00:57.639
Cow pulled hard.

16
00:00:57.640 --> 00:01:03.698
Dog pulled harder.

17
00:01:03.699 --> 00:01:07.384
Plop!

18
00:01:07.385 --> 00:01:13.046
Out came Pig at last!

19
00:01:13.047 --> 00:01:17.009
"That made me hungry!" said Pig.

20
00:01:17.010 --> 00:01:28.742
"It's time to go home," said Cow.

21
00:01:28.743 --> 00:01:31.740
Cow, Pig, and Cat walked.

22
00:01:31.741 --> 00:01:33.462
Bat flew.

23
00:01:33.463 --> 00:01:39.215
Dog ran.

24
00:01:39.216 --> 00:01:42.829
"I see the red barn," said Bat.

25
00:01:42.830 --> 00:01:45.698
"Yay!" said Pig.

26
00:01:45.699 --> 00:02:01.725
"Now I can eat!"

